  "description": "IBOFOW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C70 H84 Dy4 N4 O18,2(C20 H22 N2 O2),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.641-3.858 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.13-109.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2L2(acac)6]·2H2L·2CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
